<title>USA: TABLE-Fed Reserve business loans fell July 23 wk.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Fed Reserve business loans fell July 23 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ENDED July 23</p>
<p>(Seasonally adjusted, millions of dollars)</p>
<p> Business loans............819,700 down...2,200</p>
<p> U.S. Govt securities......718,900 down...3,500</p>
<p> Large time deposits.......597,200 down...1,200</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....871,847 down.....196</p>
<p> Financial companies.......674,899 up.....2,024</p>
<p> New York business loans....47,512 up.......434</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......47,233 up.......434</p>
